}

docs {
  Créer / agir — `POST /api/sanction-templates`

  Permission requise : `sanctions.templates`

  Corps JSON :
  - `id` (integer)
  - `name` (string) — obligatoire
  - `type` ("ban" | "kick" | "timeout" | "warn" | "restrict") — obligatoire
  - `reason` (string)
  - `duration` (string | null)
  - `scope` ("network" | "local")
  - `profile` (string | null)
  - `deleteMessageSeconds` (integer)
}
